\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n14:T699,<h1>Window LED Signage Film</h1><p>Discover Window LED Signage Film in Dubai. Transform your storefront with vibrant displays. Contact Brightluxx UAE for expert solutions today!</p><p><strong>Transform any window into dynamic advertising space.</strong></p><p>Ultra-thin (3mm) self-adhesive LED film that converts retail windows into advertising displays. 85% transparency maintains natural light and visibility. Simple peel-and-stick installation on any glass surface. Perfect for retail storefronts, bank branches, and showroom windows. WiFi content management with scheduling.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch of the Window LED Signage Film and how does it affect image quality?</h3><p>The pixel pitch is 3mm, which ensures sharp and clear visuals even at close viewing distances. This fine pitch makes it ideal for detailed graphics and text on glass surfaces.</p><h3>How bright is the Window LED Signage Film and is it suitable for daylight visibility?</h3><p>With a brightness of 4,500 nits, this LED film provides excellent visibility even in direct sunlight, making it perfect for retail storefronts exposed to outdoor daylight.</p><h3>How is the LED film installed and can it be removed without damage?</h3><p>The product uses a self-adhesive installation method that allows for simple peel-and-stick application on any glass surface. It is removable and leaves no residue behind, ensuring no damage to your windows.</p><h3>What kind of content management system is supported for displaying content?</h3><p>The Window LED Signage Film supports WiFi-based content management systems, allowing easy wireless scheduling and updating of advertisements from any location.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Window LED Signage Film Dubai - Brightluxx Premium Displays\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Discover Window LED Signage Film in Dubai. Transform your storefront with vibrant displays. Contact Brightluxx UAE for expert solutions today!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/window-led-signage-film\"}]]}]}]}],null]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{}]}]]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\",\"async\":true}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,